{"seq":29,"slug":"fourier-analysis","title":"傅里叶分析","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"傅里叶分析\">傅里叶分析</h1><p>如果你曾经盯着一段音频波形发呆，想知道里面到底藏了哪些音调；或者好奇 JPEG 是怎么把一张照片压成几分之一大小的；又或者想理解为什么深度学习里突然冒出来一个 <code>torch.fft</code> 模块——那么你已经站在傅里叶分析的门口了。这个 hub 想说清楚的核心只有一句话：任何信号都可以被拆成一组正弦波的叠加，而这种「换一个角度看问题」的能力，是工程与科学里最反复出现的杠杆之一。</p>\n<p>傅里叶分析的魅力在于它把「时间/空间域」里纠缠不清的问题，搬到「频率域」里变得一目了然。卷积在时域里是一串恼人的积分，到了频域只是两个数相乘；微分方程里的导数算子，在频域里退化成一次乘法。这种结构上的简化不是巧合，而是正弦函数作为线性时不变系统「特征函数」的必然结果。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿四条主线递进，每一条都建立在前一条之上：</p>\n<p>第一条是 <strong><a href=\"foundations/\">基础</a></strong>——先建立频域直觉，再从周期信号的傅里叶级数出发，最后用正交基与投影把「分解」这件事放进线性代数的语言里。这是整个 hub 的地基。</p>\n<p>第二条是 <strong><a href=\"transforms/\">变换</a></strong>——把周期信号的级数推广到任意信号的连续傅里叶变换，系统梳理它的代数性质，并以卷积定理作为高潮，揭示频域为何如此强大。</p>\n<p>第三条是 <strong><a href=\"discrete/\">离散与快速</a></strong>——计算机只能处理有限的离散数据，于是有了离散傅里叶变换 DFT；而让它真正可用的，是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 砍到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 FFT 算法；采样定理则回答了「离散」与「连续」之间的桥梁该如何安全跨越。</p>\n<p>第四条是 <strong><a href=\"practice/\">实践</a></strong>——真实信号是有限长且有噪声的，于是需要窗函数与谱估计；从音频降噪到图像压缩是傅里叶最广为人知的战场；而当信号是非平稳的（频率随时间变化），傅里叶的全局性就成了短板，小波分析接棒登场。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：本 hub 只讲傅里叶分析本身。它频繁用到复数与欧拉公式，但复指数、留数、解析延拓的系统理论属于 <a href=\"../complex-analysis/\">复分析 (20)</a>；它会提到傅里叶变换求解热方程/波动方程，但偏微分方程的求解框架属于 <a href=\"../differential-equations/\">微分方程 (17)</a>；它会讨论 FFT 的数值实现，但浮点误差、数值稳定性的一般理论属于 <a href=\"../numerical-methods/\">数值方法 (06)</a>；正交基与投影的线性代数基础在 <a href=\"../linear-algebra/\">线性代数 (01)</a> 里有更完整的展开。本 hub 遇到这些概念时只点到为止并交叉链接过去，不重复展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：信号处理初学者按 1→2→3→4 顺序通读即可；只关心工程应用的开发者可以从「频域思想」快速过一遍，然后直接跳到 DFT、FFT、采样混叠与谱分析这四篇硬核工程篇；有数学背景、想看清结构的读者，重点读正交基、变换性质与卷积定理三篇。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：会基本的微积分（积分、求导）、复数的四则运算与欧拉公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{i\\theta}=\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，以及向量内积的概念。不需要预先掌握测度论或泛函分析——本 hub 会在需要时给出直观解释。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frequency-domain-idea","title":"频域思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/foundations/frequency-domain-idea"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fourier-series","title":"傅里叶级数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/foundations/fourier-series"},{"seq":3,"slug":"orthogonal-basis","title":"正交基与投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/foundations/orthogonal-basis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"transforms","title":"变换","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/transforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continuous-fourier-transform","title":"连续傅里叶变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/transforms/continuous-fourier-transform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transform-properties","title":"变换性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/transforms/transform-properties"},{"seq":3,"slug":"convolution-theorem","title":"卷积定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/transforms/convolution-theorem"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"discrete","title":"离散与快速","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dft","title":"离散傅里叶变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/dft"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fft-algorithm","title":"FFT 快速算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/fft-algorithm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-aliasing","title":"采样与混叠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/sampling-aliasing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spectral-analysis","title":"谱分析与窗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice/spectral-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fourier-applications","title":"信号与图像应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice/fourier-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-fourier-wavelets","title":"超越傅里叶：小波","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/practice/beyond-fourier-wavelets"}]}]}